sentences.l:
“The scar first, this one, observe with your eyes,
which on Parnassus me struck a boar with white tooth
as I went;

But come, to you also the trees in the well-built plot
let me tell, which you once gave me, and I asked you for each,
being a child, through the garden following;

and vine-rows to me thus you named,
you would give, fifty, each one vintage-through
it was;

such being, for you, yesterday, in our house,
arms having on my shoulders, to stand by and to ward off
the men, the suitors;

and out the dead from the house they carried, and buried them, each group,
and those from other cities, to his home each one,
they sent to be conveyed, to fishermen on swift ships placing them;
